@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@pingUrl = http://localhost:5200

### 1. Thong tin dich vu: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap dang mo: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop: 201 + Location; ghi nho ID tu response
# @name createSubmission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200349",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/dtc245200349/signalr"
}

### 4. Chay request 3 truoc; cho 5 giay: 200, graded
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Thieu hai truong: 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Bai tap khong ton tai: 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 7. Luot nop khong ton tai: 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR: 200, connectionId, cac transport
POST {{baseUrl}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan: 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. Bai tap da dong: 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 11. PingSignalR bat tay: 200 (mo Ping.Api cong 5200 truoc)
POST {{pingUrl}}/hubs/ping/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 12. Bai tap mo rong: HTTP 201 received, sau 3 giay failed vi repository khong https
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "http://example.com/invalid-repository"
}
